            <div xml:id="d511">

                <pb facs="0693" n="599" xml:id="pg599"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-07-01"><hi rendition="#italic">July 1,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs says he has worked diligently Delgado case and will
                    give written answer to-morrow. Would say nothing more definite than <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi> case will be decided as soon as
                    possible.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
